+/*
+ * Enter, observe, or leave QEMU's process-lifetime all-block drain section.
+ * Hold and release run under the BQL on the main AioContext.  Hold uses the
+ * native no-poll begin operation so already-issued I/O can finish after the
+ * command returns while every new external client remains quiesced.
